{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --earth-1:#3b2f2f; /* deep umber */
      --earth-2:#7a5a3c; /* warm clay */
      --earth-3:#d9c9b8; /* soft parchment */
      --accent:#8aa394; /* muted sage */
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background-color:var(--earth-3);color:var(--earth-1);}
    .site-wrap{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-image:url("assets/img/pattern.svg");background-repeat:repeat;background-size:160px;}
    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(59,47,47,0.95), rgba(59,47,47,0.88));color:var(--glass);padding:20px 18px;border-bottom:4px solid rgba(138,163,148,0.08);}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    nav a{color:var(--glass);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px;font-size:14px}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.92), rgba(255,255,255,0.98));padding:22px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(58,40,20,0.08)}
    h2{margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--earth-1)}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.06);color:var(--earth-1)}
    form.session-planner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--earth-1)}
    input[type='text'],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6dcd2;background:white;font-size:14px}
    .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}
    .card-block{padding:14px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(250,246,242,0.9);border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.04)}
    .result{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(59,47,47,0.06);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono', monospace;font-size:13px}
    footer{margin-top:auto;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:900px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .checks{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site-wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="nav">
        <div class="brand">
          <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden>
            <rect width="44" height="44" rx="8" fill="var(--earth-2)"></rect>
            <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="10" fill="var(--accent)"></circle>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--glass)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav>
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="conditions.html">Issues</a>
          <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Join</a>
          <a href="about.html">Team</a>
          <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
          <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h2>Connect with the practice</h2>
          <p class="lead">Use the planner below to sketch a personalized session plan and a consult agenda based on what matters most. Then share or copy the summary for your first visit.</p>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px">
            <div class="contact-list">
              <div class="muted">Phone</div>
              <a class="small" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>
              <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Email</div>
              <a class="small" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-block small">
            <strong>Visit options</strong>
            <div style="margin-top:8px" class="muted">We offer ongoing membership plans and single-session evaluations. Membership includes guided check-ins and a tailored pathway.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-card">
          <h2 style="font-size:18px">Session Planner</h2>
          <p class="muted">Build a concise plan and a consultation agenda. Copy the summary for appointment notes or to share with our intake team.</p>

          <form class="session-planner" id="planner" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="First and last">

            <label for="goal">Primary goal for sessions</label>
            <input id="goal" type="text" placeholder="What outcome matters most?">

            <label>Whole-person inventory — check areas to include in the consultation</label>
            <div class="checks" id="areas">
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep"> Sleep</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Nutrition"> Nutrition</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Movement"> Movement</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Stress & Mood"> Stress & Mood</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Energy & Fatigue"> Energy & Fatigue</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Digestive Health"> Digestive Health</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Hormonal Health"> Hormonal Health</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" value="Environment"> Environment & Exposure</label>
            </div>

            <label for="cadence">Preferred contact cadence</label>
            <select id="cadence">
              <option value="weekly">Weekly check-ins</option>
              <option value="biweekly">Every other week</option>
              <option value="monthly">Monthly visits</option>
              <option value="asneeded">As needed / flexible</option>
            </select>

            <label for="duration">Session length</label>
            <select id="duration">
              <option value="30">30 minutes</option>
              <option value="45">45 minutes</option>
              <option value="60">60 minutes</option>
            </select>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <button class="btn" id="build">Create plan</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="clear">Reset</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="muted">Generated plan</div>
            <div id="output" class="result" aria-live="polite">No plan yet — use the form to create a short plan.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn" id="copy">Copy summary</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="download">Download .txt</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;align-items:start">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h2 style="font-size:16px">Consultation agenda & follow-up</h2>
          <p class="muted">The checklist above informs a focused intake agenda and a follow-up cadence. Below we show the logic used so you see how recommendations are built.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <h3 style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px">How areas map to agenda items</h3>
            <ul class="small" style="margin:0 0 8px 18px;color:var(--muted)">
              <li><strong>Sleep:</strong> sleep history, sleep hygiene, brief screening for disordered sleep.</li>
              <li><strong>Nutrition:</strong> patterns, food sensitivities, targeted labs if indicated.</li>
              <li><strong>Movement:</strong> daily activity, mobility, realistic exercise targets.</li>
              <li><strong>Stress & Mood:</strong> context, coping strategies, circadian cues.</li>
              <li><strong>Energy & Fatigue:</strong> timeline, triggers, medication review.</li>
              <li><strong>Digestive Health:</strong> bowel patterns, food response, simple testing plan.</li>
              <li><strong>Hormonal Health:</strong> cycles, symptoms, relevant labs conversation.</li>
              <li><strong>Environment:</strong> exposures, sleep/chemical considerations, immediate mitigations.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="font-size:14px;margin-top:10px">Typical follow-up cadence</h3>
            <div class="small muted">Based on selections, the planner suggests an initial review at 2–6 weeks with a membership-led cadence afterwards oriented around coaching and monitoring. These are educational recommendations, not treatment guarantees.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick intake</h3>
          <div class="muted small">If you'd like direct help converting the plan into an intake appointment, share the copied plan in an email when you schedule.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a class="btn" href="book.html">Request first appointment</a>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
            <strong>Location</strong>
            <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px"><a class="small" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:20px">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Privacy & note</h3>
          <div class="small muted">Information entered here is for planning and preparation only. It is not a clinical record until you complete intake through our secured channels. No diagnoses are made on this page. If you are in crisis, contact local emergency services.</div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — <span class="small">Membership care • Integrative guidance</span></div>
        <div class="small">Phone <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      const areaMap = {
        "Sleep": {agenda: "Sleep timeline + basic hygiene review", follow: "Sleep diary + 2-week check-in"},
        "Nutrition": {agenda: "Diet pattern review + food sensitivity screening conversation", follow: "3-week food log review"},
        "Movement": {agenda: "Mobility and routine assessment; realistic goals", follow: "Progress check in 4 weeks"},
        "Stress & Mood": {agenda: "Contextual stress mapping; brief mood screen", follow: "Weekly short check-ins by message"},
        "Energy & Fatigue": {agenda: "Energy timeline and triggers; med review", follow: "Lab review or energy plan at 4 weeks"},
        "Digestive Health": {agenda: "Bowel pattern, bloating, reflux screening", follow: "Trial diet or targeted testing and 3-week check"},
        "Hormonal Health": {agenda: "Cycle and symptom review; baseline labs conversation", follow: "Hormone tracking + 6-week follow-up"},
        "Environment": {agenda: "Exposure history and sleep environment review", follow: "Mitigation steps and 2-week follow-up"}
      };

      const planner = document.getElementById('planner');
      const buildBtn = document.getElementById('build');
      const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear');
      const output = document.getElementById('output');
      const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy');
      const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('download');

      function collect(){
        const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
        const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value.trim();
        const cadence = document.getElementById('cadence').value;
        const duration = document.getElementById('duration').value;
        const checked = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#areas input:checked')).map(n=>n.value);
        return {name,goal,cadence,duration,checked};
      }

      function cadenceLabel(c){
        switch(c){
          case 'weekly': return 'Weekly check-ins';
          case 'biweekly': return 'Every other week';
          case 'monthly': return 'Monthly';
          default: return 'Flexible / as needed';
        }
      }

      function buildText(data){
        const who = data.name || 'Client';
        let lines = [];
        lines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Session plan summary');
        lines.push('Name: '+who);
        lines.push('Primary goal: '+(data.goal||'Not specified'));
        lines.push('Preferred cadence: '+cadenceLabel(data.cadence));
        lines.push('Session length: '+data.duration+' minutes');
        lines.push('');

        if(data.checked.length===0){
          lines.push('Focus areas: none selected');
        } else {
          lines.push('Focus areas: '+data.checked.join(', '));
          lines.push('');
          lines.push('Suggested intake agenda:');
          data.checked.forEach(area=>{
            const map = areaMap[area];
            if(map) lines.push('- '+area+': '+map.agenda);
            else lines.push('- '+area+': standard review');
          });
          lines.push('');
          lines.push('Suggested follow-up cadence:');
          data.checked.forEach(area=>{
            const map = areaMap[area];
            if(map) lines.push('- '+area+': '+map.follow);
          });
        }

        lines.push('');
        lines.push('Notes: This is an educational planning summary to help you prepare for an intake. It is not a diagnosis.');
        lines.push('Contact: '+{{JSON.stringify('{{EMAIL}}')}}+' | '+{{JSON.stringify('{{PHONE}}')}});
        return lines.join('\n');
      }

      buildBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const data = collect();
        const text = buildText(data);
        output.textContent = text;
      });

      clearBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        planner.reset();
        output.textContent = 'No plan yet — use the form to create a short plan.';
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const text = output.textContent;
        if(!text) return;
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{
          copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent='Copy summary',1200);
        }).catch(()=>{
          alert('Unable to copy — please select and copy manually.');
        });
      });

      downloadBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const text = output.textContent;
        const blob = new Blob([text], {type: 'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = url;
        a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        a.remove();
        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page — chunk 4 for "holistic_medicine" site

This file set includes the contact page (contact.html) and this README. The contact page implements a local interactive "Session Planner" and a whole-person inventory built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No external assets or CDNs are required.

Features
- Session Planner form that collects name, primary goal, chosen focus areas (whole-person inventory), preferred cadence, and session length.
- Generates a plaintext summary that:
  - Lists selected focus areas
  - Provides a suggested intake agenda that maps each area to agenda items
  - Suggests follow-up cadence items for each area
  - Includes contact placeholders and a privacy note
- Copy summary button uses the Clipboard API (graceful fallback alerts on failure).
- Download button exports the plan as session-plan.txt.
- Reset button clears the form and output.
- UI uses warm earthy palette and references assets/img/pattern.svg for background pattern (unique SVG is provided elsewhere in the bundle).

Placeholders present in the file (replace before publishing):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes for integrators
- contact.html is standalone and expects the site to include assets/img/pattern.svg in the site assets. The SVG should be unique for this theme.
- The planner logic is intentionally educational: it generates suggested agendas and cadence. It does not perform diagnostics and includes a privacy note.
- The export text includes placeholders. If you need the raw email/phone embedded, replace the placeholders during server-side rendering.

Testing
1. Open contact.html in a modern browser.
2. Fill name, goal, pick several areas and cadence, then click "Create plan".
3. Review the generated text area. Use "Copy summary" to copy to clipboard or "Download .txt" to save.
4. Try "Reset" to clear.

Accessibility and behavior
- The generated summary is placed in an element with aria-live for polite updates.
- Copy uses navigator.clipboard; ensure served over HTTPS for full support.

Developer tips
- To alter mappings, edit the areaMap object in the inline script.
- To change offered cadence labels, edit cadenceLabel() in the script.

Licensing
- This chunk contains no external libraries. Use and modify freely within the project.
"} 
